===A0_S2_D2===
//orb 2
Narrator: You try to push the memories of your family's anger aside.
Narrator: The realm of sleep is calming; quiet. Like the ocean at night.
Mother: <i>Noelle, one day, you’ll take over as the head of our family.</i>
Mother: <i>You’ll be the greatest wayfinder amongst us and lead us through the floods.</i>
Narrator: ...What happened to you? 
Narrator: The ceremony you’d been looking forward to as a child — the special day your mother told you about,
Narrator: braiding your hair while reminding you of how wonderful it’d be...
Narrator: She was always strict when it came to the Tempest legacy.
Narrator: But you never expected the ceremony to take such a turn.
Mother: <i>The Tempests have guided and led our island to safety for centuries.</i> 
Mother: <i>Once you come of age, you too…</i>
